omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nYxYJZLDzhUQ7kNvwEkbJ4b&_nc_oc=AdrSynTtckAHlt1ZYw4KPzG-8pWZ3Eb9wuIp8RKnVd9BKIB7MC303k8sSZ976gH3X0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGiZPDPEuqAUFdDdTliYwGw2X0dQAPmOedr-kjVNgS6-g&oe=6A7079F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XtUWmFBbVfsQ7kNvwGJH29y&_nc_oc=AdpUoLRS4J27eS0pOzsJdebkS3xTpaHiQ3g3rnT4jwTLM8KK_WEcYbjGPPOYCg8-fQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEXwylLRQtRCsZyx3RGr3TvmiFgRfDRn8iQGsoSA1oIAg&oe=6A707B56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k4Km1-5ACAMQ7kNvwE0f53Z&_nc_oc=Adp_f7CrR9PAz6y8oy6zLz3E4VLwQI9WTId0ux90DNC2IrdgixP2_yO7NHS3qNqd-YQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEejw_mxz75Q4SRmohJuGOeQ1McaUSUZjY9GnwAEa23dg&oe=6A709077"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://